# Force LF on checkout on every platform (crlfcheckout, C.1.3.2).
# Critical for this repo: dist/aifs-exec.bundle.js and dist/aifs-exec.sh must stay
# byte-identical to the LF-committed blobs, or a Windows checkout CRLF-converts them
# and the bundle SHA no longer matches adapter.json's exec_bundle_checksum (the
# integrity gate) — and a hand-copied bundle ships corrupted. With this, the working
# tree equals the commit, so the canonical SHA holds on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
dist/aifs-exec.bundle.js text eol=lf
dist/aifs-exec.sh text eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
